1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
Welcome to the unit.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:06,370
Learning to learn. B.

3
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:13,830
Millie and her classmates are talking about the most important thing for successful learning.

4
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:17,190
Work in groups and give your opinions.

5
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:20,740
Use the conversation below as a model.

6
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:27,430
Do you think it's important for successful learning, Daniel?

7
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:33,060
For me, one thing is to have strong drive to learn.

8
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:37,020
If you're willing to learn, you'll work harder.

9
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,830
Yes, I agree.

10
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:44,360
And it's also important to have a good teacher.

11
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:50,560
A good teacher will guide you on the right path. True.

12
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:54,590
And you need to have good study skills.

13
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:59,240
They'll help you learn better. That's right.

14
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:02,370
And we should also make a study plan.

15
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:05,720
It'll help us manage our time well.

16
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:08,260
I couldn't agree more.
